# Profanity filter
#
# Personal list. Write SINGLE words here, one per line, not phrases made
# of several words, because the Transcriber checks each word separately
# and censors matches in place, rather than dropping the whole sentence
# like blocklist.txt does. Partial match, ignoring accents and punctuation.
# Extend freely.

darn
shoot
crap
dang
geez
heck
gosh
blast
